in this tide

278
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:17,870
the last token we were waiting for finally appeared.

279
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,990
It's not what I said,

280
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:21,910
but what Heavenly Fate said.

281
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,390
Do we take it

282
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,190
or not ?

283
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:28,470
Back then, we suffered heavy losses.

284
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,990
If we want to obtain the token now,

285
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:33,510
we need to be prepared.

286
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:38,510
I think 200 years is enough,

287
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:41,430
then we'll enter the Demon Spirit Land together again

288
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,470
and retrieve the token.

289
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,510
In that case,

290
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:48,750
we'll meet again in 200 years.

291
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:52,350
My disciple Wang Lin

292
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:54,990
is a person of great fortune.

293
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,870
I just don't know

294
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:59,430
how much fortune

295
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,390
he has left.

296
00:18:11,620 --> 00:20:16,080
Not only have the character appearances been retconned but this flashback does not represent Situ Nan's defeat we see in episode 1.

This must be an earlier fight before that. The reason I'm thinking this is because Na Duo fought the Soul Refining Sect's Fourth Ancestor and was defeated by him so he cannot be present in the final fight against Situ Nan. Yes, I know I'm nitpicking...

297
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:22,800
I've been walking this path for endless years

298
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:22,800
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

299
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:28,400
Is it the compass of fate

300
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:28,400
that wrote this outcome for us ?

301
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:34,320
The heavens want to erase your existence,

302
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:40,040
that's the obsession guiding me.

303
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:45,640
Is this the path to uncover

304
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:45,640
truths from falsehoods ?

305
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:51,240
In a world of murk and shadow,

306
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:51,240
only the flame of truth can light the way.

307
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:56,960
Look at them all,

308
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:56,960
being carried by the waves.

309
00:18:57,400 --> 00:19:01,600
Look at them all,

310
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:01,600
being drowned.

311
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:04,920
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

312
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:08,000
I will let the world refine my soul.

313
00:19:08,130 --> 00:19:13,560
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

314
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:13,560
I will fight.

315
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:16,680
I'll break through the abyss of despair

316
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:19,720
to finally learn who I really am.

317
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:25,080
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

318
00:19:21,600 --> 00:19:25,080
I embrace this obsession.

319
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:28,040
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

320
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:30,840
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

321
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:36,320
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

322
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:36,320
I'll still fight.

323
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:39,680
It's hard to avoid loneliness

324
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:42,720
when you are above everyone else.

325
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:48,400
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

326
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:48,400
be afraid of a firefly ?
